648
00:39:37.833 --> 00:39:38.667
Keep going!

649
00:39:39.210 --> 00:39:40.753
You can get it. You can get one bag.

650
00:39:41.337 --> 00:39:42.171
We don't quit!

651
00:39:42.254 --> 00:39:43.964
Come on! Keep going till the end!

652
00:39:44.548 --> 00:39:46.008
Let's all do this together!

653
