00:41:53.844 --> 00:41:56.347
JAPAN
18 CRATES, 46 BAGS

687
00:41:56.430 --> 00:41:58.974
AUSTRALIA
22 CRATES, 50 BAGS

688
00:41:59.058 --> 00:42:01.393
We did our absolute best.

689
