We were so excited.

697
00:42:28.671 --> 00:42:32.216
The key factor for winning quest two
was teamwork.

698
00:42:32.299 --> 00:42:34.093
Without a doubt, it was teamwork.

699
00:42:34.176 --> 00:42:35.511
Yeah, I'm very proud.

700
00:42:36.262 --> 00:42:39.181
I feel like the team
is becoming a family even more.

701
00:42:39.265 --> 00:42:40.474
Time to throw it. Get that out.

702
00:42:52.528 --> 00:42:55.531
Oh, this is legitimately…

703
00:42:56.782 --> 00:42:59.994
-Oh my gosh.
-Wow.

704
00:43:05.958 --> 00:43:06.834
It's a shipwreck.

705
00:43:07.835 --> 00:43:10.588
There's a shipwreck.

706
00:43:11.547 --> 00:43:15.968
The second quest of Physical: Asia

707
00:43:16.051 --> 00:43:18.429
