720
00:43:50.377 --> 00:43:51.754
I can do the crates.

721
00:43:52.796 --> 00:43:55.924
I assigned the roles to each member.

722
00:43:56.634 --> 00:44:00.638
We assigned Ray to carry the boxes.

723
00:44:00.721 --> 00:44:03.891
And also, Robyn was on the rope.

724
00:44:04.600 --> 00:44:06.477
This is what I think.

725
00:44:06.560 --> 00:44:08.687
Let's forget about the sandbags.

726
00:44:08.771 --> 00:44:10.731
We should transport the crates first.

727
00:44:11.523 --> 00:44:13.609
-And Ochir will go up, right?
-Yeah.

728
00:44:14.318 --> 00:44:15.736
LKHAGVA-OCHIR
CIRCUS ARTIST

729
00:44:15.819 --> 00:44:18.614
I'd already assumed the role was mine
as soon as I saw it.

730
00:44:18.697 --> 00:44:21.200
Team Mongolia,
they're gonna go home after this.

731
00:44:21.283 --> 00:44:22.826
-Yeah, 100%.
-Yeah, of course, 100%.

732
00:44:22.910 --> 00:44:23.911
Send them home, Manny.

733
00:44:23.994 --> 00:44:24.828
We'll send them home.

734
00:44:26.163 --> 00:44:27.247
-Definitely. Let's get in here.
-Yeah!

735
00:44:27.331 --> 00:44:28.916
-Let's go!
-Let's fight!

736
00:44:28.999 --> 00:44:30.167
-Philippines!
-Philippines!

737
00:44:32.920 --> 00:44:34.672
Mongolia is a strong team.

738
00:44:36.507 --> 00:44:39.927
But we can beat them with our strategy.

739
00:44:40.928 --> 00:44:43.097
My focus is on winning.

740
00:44:45.057 --> 00:44:46.725
-Warriors, mount up!
-Mount up!

741
00:44:49.311 --> 00:44:50.437
ORKHONBAYAR
BÖKH WRESTLER

742
00:44:50.521 --> 00:44:53.273
Whatever strategy Team Philippines uses
is of no concern to us.

743
00:44:53.357 --> 00:44:56.360
We're just going to focus
on our own strategy.

744
00:44:56.860 --> 00:44:57.861
Stand by.

745
00:44:57.945 --> 00:44:58.987
Get ready to roll, guys.

746
00:45:00.406 --> 00:45:01.407
Ready…

747
00:45:01.490 --> 00:45:02.616
Let's go. Come on!

748
00:45:14.461 --> 00:45:16.338
Mongolians! Charge!

749
00:45:18.799 --> 00:45:20.843
Mongolians! Charge!

750
00:45:39.278 --> 00:45:41.363
Go, go. Let's go!

751
00:45:44.950 --> 00:45:45.909
Pick up, guys.

752
00:45:47.453 --> 00:45:49.204
It's 20 kg each.

753
00:45:49.705 --> 00:45:52.833
So we focused exclusively on the bags.

754
00:45:54.001 --> 00:45:55.377
And also, there's…

755
00:45:55.461 --> 00:45:59.590
We assigned Ray to carry the boxes.

756
00:46:21.612 --> 00:46:23.697
I'm good. Go, go. Ray, go.

757
00:46:25.073 --> 00:46:28.619
The reason is because
I'm the lightest out of everyone

758
00:46:28.702 --> 00:46:29.703
