so this was right up my alley.

787
00:48:59.686 --> 00:49:00.979
Breathe, Ray. You got this.

788
00:49:01.063 --> 00:49:02.314
Keep breathing, you got it.

789
00:49:02.397 --> 00:49:04.524
Ray!

790
00:49:04.608 --> 00:49:05.525
Focus.

791
00:49:06.443 --> 00:49:07.402
Ray!

792
00:49:08.695 --> 00:49:12.491
I saw Ray having a difficult time.

793
00:49:12.574 --> 00:49:14.868
That's why I started telling him…

794
00:49:15.577 --> 00:49:18.288
Ray! Come down here and move the bags.

795
00:49:21.541 --> 00:49:23.752
I gave him a different role

796
00:49:23.835 --> 00:49:27.297
so he could help the team.

797
00:49:29.758 --> 00:49:30.717
You got this, Ray.

798
00:49:31.718 --> 00:49:32.719
Come on, guys!

799
00:49:38.975 --> 00:49:40.936
I kept on telling myself,

800
00:49:41.019 --> 00:49:43.980
"You really have to keep pushing."

801
00:49:45.691 --> 00:49:47.317
"Do not give up. Help your team."

802
00:49:54.116 --> 00:49:56.034
I hated the thought of losing.

803
00:49:57.285 --> 00:50:04.209
I wanted to win,
so I continued to move the bags.

804
00:50:05.544 --> 00:50:07.462
Down this way!

805
00:50:08.088 --> 00:50:08.922
Lift it up here.

806
00:50:11.508 --> 00:50:12.551
Put it over.

807
00:50:12.634 --> 00:50:13.635
You going to be okay?

808
00:50:13.719 --> 00:50:15.095
-Yeah, I can take more.
-One more?

809
00:50:15.178 --> 00:50:17.389
Yeah, come on.

810
00:50:17.472 --> 00:50:20.559
-No, I'll take this one in my hand.
-Okay, be careful.

811
00:50:21.560 --> 00:50:26.440
Upholding the honor of your country
is important here.

812
00:50:27.941 --> 00:50:31.486
We're here to win the championship.

813
00:50:49.713 --> 00:50:52.966
I cried out,
driven by my determination to win.

814
00:50:55.719 --> 00:50:59.306
Manny. I can see the motivation
and his dedication for the team.

815
00:51:00.515 --> 00:51:03.769
I think for me,
that was my motivation also,

816
00:51:03.852 --> 00:51:06.938
so that I wouldn't
stop the transportation.

817
00:51:12.944 --> 00:51:15.614
-One, two.
-One, two.

818
00:51:20.535 --> 00:51:24.331
-Bring over some bags.
-Yeah, they're coming.

819
00:51:24.956 --> 00:51:27.459
We all bring crates and pile them up here.

820
00:51:27.542 --> 00:51:32.506
Once Ochir starts slowing down,
we leave the crates,

821
00:51:32.589 --> 00:51:35.926
bring as many bags as we can,
and chuck them down there.

822
00:51:36.927 --> 00:51:38.887
Look, spin as you throw it
over your shoulder.

823
00:51:40.847 --> 00:51:41.765
That's it.

824
00:51:44.059 --> 00:51:45.477
Carry them on your shoulder.

825
00:51:47.395 --> 00:51:50.065
Here, put them on your shoulder.
There you go.

826
00:51:53.610 --> 00:51:57.113
Some of the bags being tied together
actually worked to my advantage.

827
00:51:57.906 --> 00:52:00.992
I thought, "This is great.
The more the better."

828
00:52:03.161 --> 00:52:06.122
It was perfect for carrying
several of them in one go.

829
00:52:08.542 --> 00:52:11.294
All right, get down there!
Get down there and load them up!

830
00:52:18.718 --> 00:52:19.636
Come on, guys.

831
00:52:23.807 --> 00:52:26.101
7 BAGS

832
00:52:28.436 --> 00:52:29.437
Come on!

833
00:52:29.521 --> 00:52:31.690
Get low, guys! Push low!

834
00:52:32.315 --> 00:52:34.693
Yes! Push low, guys.

835
00:52:34.776 --> 00:52:36.111
Next step, come on.

836
00:52:36.194 --> 00:52:37.195
Next step.

837
00:52:46.204 --> 00:52:47.038
Let's unload.

838
00:52:48.999 --> 00:52:50.375
This one's f****** 80 kilos.

839
00:52:51.251 --> 00:52:52.460
This one's 80 kilos.

840
00:52:58.466 --> 00:53:00.927
-One, two, three!
-Two, three.

841
00:53:21.489 --> 00:53:22.616
Ten minutes.

842
00:53:23.241 --> 00:53:24.242
Ten minutes left.

843
00:53:25.869 --> 00:53:26.912
Ten minutes. Come on!

844
00:53:28.121 --> 00:53:29.831
Revealing the interim weight score.

845
00:53:35.587 --> 00:53:36.421
Damn.

846
00:53:39.883 --> 00:53:40.967
We're the same!

847
00:53:45.263 --> 00:53:46.514
We're 400 each!

848
00:53:52.354 --> 00:53:53.521
We're the same!

849
00:55:50.930 --> 00:55:55.935
Subtitle translation by: Jee Butcher

